OL,3,GNEWSARail firms waive fares for
OL,4,ARemembrance events
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilitary personnel and veterans can
OL,7,Ftravel from the West Midlands to
OL,8,Fselected Remembrance events for free
OL,9,Fafter rail providers temporarily waived
OL,10,Fticket fees.
OL,12,FThe offer applies to those going to
OL,13,Fevents in London over the weekend of 31
OL,14,FOctober to 1 November, and on 8
OL,15,FNovember.
OL,17,FFree return travel to services
OL,18,Felsewhere, including in Birmingham,
OL,19,FCoventry, Wolverhampton and at the
OL,20,FRoyal British Legion National
OL,21,FRemembrance Gardens in Staffordshire,
OL,22,Fwill be available on 8 November only.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
